            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I find \"hints\" very useful when the most relevant results of the picker are listed first, or when the results are predictable.\r\n\r\nThis is possible without modifying mini.pick, see [this](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/discussions/1109) discussion.\r\n\r\nI have been [using](https://github.com/abeldekat/nvim_pde/blob/b710e97a341c8ca77f61f8208d288dc9fc188ec4/lua/ak/mini/pick.lua#L18) that [code](https://github.com/abeldekat/nvim_pde/blob/b710e97a341c8ca77f61f8208d288dc9fc188ec4/lua/akextra/pick_hinted.lua#L1) daily for more than a year now. Perhaps it's useful for you too.",
